# Terrateam

> Terrateam is a GitOps-native infrastructure orchestration platform for Terraform and OpenTofu. It automates infrastructure changes through pull requests with built-in security, policy enforcement, and multi-environment orchestration. Terrateam also offers infrastructure consulting services for Terraform/OpenTofu migrations, managed infrastructure, and bare-metal-to-cloud transitions.

Terrateam is self-hosted or cloud, your state, secrets, and code never leave your infrastructure. Built in OCaml for type safety and performance. The product documentation lives at https://docs.terrateam.io and the application at https://app.terrateam.io.

## Product
- [GitOps for Terraform & OpenTofu](https://terrateam.io/gitops): Automate IaC through pull requests.
- [Orchestration Engine](https://terrateam.io/orchestration-engine): Dependencies, parallelism, multi-env at scale.
- [Stacks (Layered Runs)](https://terrateam.io/stacks): Nested and layered Terraform stacks.
- [Technical Architecture](https://terrateam.io/technical-architecture): Deep dive on the OCaml platform.
- [Deployment Options](https://terrateam.io/product/deployment): Cloud and on-premises.
- [Security & Compliance](https://terrateam.io/product/security-and-compliance): Security model and compliance posture.
- [OpenInfraQuote](https://terrateam.io/product/openinfraquote): Open-source infrastructure cost estimation tool.
- [Pricing](https://terrateam.io/pricing): Simple, predictable pricing tiers.
- [Philosophy](https://terrateam.io/philosophy): Infrastructure sovereignty, no vendor lock-in.

